1
00:00:00,800 --> 00:00:04,629
Welcome to Melody and
Barnaby's Music Nuggets!

2
00:00:05,629 --> 00:00:10,713
Today we are going to learn
about sharps and flats.

3
00:00:12,713 --> 00:00:17,099
The very next key…
is called a semitone.

4
00:00:22,299 --> 00:00:25,897
One semitone higher… is a sharp.

5
00:00:31,297 --> 00:00:32,397
C

6
00:00:32,447 --> 00:00:33,676
Sharp.

7
00:00:33,876 --> 00:00:35,022
F

8
00:00:35,072 --> 00:00:36,301
Sharp.

9
00:00:36,501 --> 00:00:37,648
G

10
00:00:37,698 --> 00:00:38,926
Sharp.

11
00:00:42,526 --> 00:00:45,891
One semitone lower… is a flat.

12
00:00:51,291 --> 00:00:52,485
D

13
00:00:52,535 --> 00:00:53,735
Flat.

14
00:00:53,870 --> 00:00:54,971
B

15
00:00:55,021 --> 00:00:56,221
Flat.

16
00:00:56,357 --> 00:00:57,332
E

17
00:00:57,382 --> 00:00:58,582
Flat.

18
00:01:02,117 --> 00:01:04,089
These are the signs.

19
00:01:04,589 --> 00:01:05,818
Sharp.

20
00:01:06,318 --> 00:01:07,518
Flat.

21
00:01:12,154 --> 00:01:14,915
Your turn! Listen and look.

22
00:01:15,315 --> 00:01:17,705
Sharp… or flat?

23
00:01:21,605 --> 00:01:22,834
Sharp.

24
00:01:25,634 --> 00:01:28,024
Sharp… or flat?

25
00:01:31,924 --> 00:01:33,124
Flat.

26
00:01:33,960 --> 00:01:35,281
You've got it!

27
00:01:36,981 --> 00:01:38,442
Now it's your turn!

28
00:01:38,642 --> 00:01:42,657
Play Sharp or Flat and
name the black keys!

29
00:01:44,457 --> 00:01:48,767
Grown-ups, subscribe so
you never miss a Nugget.

30
00:01:48,817 --> 00:01:52,002
New ones every Wednesday and Saturday.

31
00:01:52,302 --> 00:01:54,692
See you for the next Nugget!

